flowchart TD
  S([What does your dApp need?])
  S --> Q1{Read status, or<br/>verify a fresh proof?}

  Q1 -->|Read on-chain status| Q2{Individual or<br/>business?}
  Q1 -->|Verify a credential proof| D[Pattern D<br/>EligibilityWidget + backend verifier]

  Q2 -->|Individual| Q3{Already onboarded?}
  Q2 -->|Business| Q4{Already a verified business?}

  Q3 -->|Yes| A[Pattern A<br/>useHasChainPermission + EligibilityGate]
  Q3 -->|No| B[Pattern B<br/>IndividualOnboarding then refetch]

  Q4 -->|Yes| A2[useBusinessDetails<br/>read company details]
  Q4 -->|No| C[Pattern C<br/>BusinessOnboardingSdk then refetchBusinessIdentifier]

  D --> SENS{Also need durable<br/>on-chain permission?}
  SENS -->|Yes| COMBO[Combine D + A]
  SENS -->|No| DONE([Done])
  A --> DONE
  A2 --> DONE
  B --> DONE
  C --> DONE
  COMBO --> DONE
